OL,3,GNEWSAMeteorological mast approved for
OL,4,Apower station
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new meteorological mast and other
OL,7,Fequipment will be built at a power
OL,8,Fstation.
OL,10,FEDF Nuclear Energy Generation Limited
OL,11,Fapplied for an equipment compound at
OL,12,FHartlepool Power Station, off Tees
OL,13,FRoad, which includes a 10m (32ft)
OL,14,Flattice mast, a data logger closet and
OL,15,Fanti-climb security fencing.
OL,17,FThe scheme followed an assessment at
OL,18,Feach of EDF's operational power
OL,19,Fstations, which found existing
OL,20,Fmeteorological measurement arrangements
OL,21,Fcould be improved.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,394,390,260,160,0,100
