OL,3,GNEWSAMeteorological mast approved for
OL,4,Apower station
OL,5,
OL,6,FHartlepool Borough Council approved the
OL,7,Fapplication which detailed the
OL,8,Fdevelopment was needed to measure,
OL,9,Fcollect and analyse data to provide an
OL,10,F"accurate baseline of weather
OL,11,Fconditions".
